  "details": "With this update, new controller bindings have been applied.\n\nHowever, they overwrite the bindings set in SteamVR, so even if the new bindings are set, it is difficult to get close to the previous behavior, making it difficult to use.\n\nIn fact, some of the friends I just met were similarly puzzled by the inability to use existing bindings.\n\nPlease add the ability to switch to the existing bindings set in SteamVR.",
